                    FREE OF CHARGE, apprenti.dev'S AGGREGATE LIABILITY FOR ANY
                    CLAIM RELATED TO THE APP IS LIMITED TO THE FULLEST EXTENT
                    PERMITTED BY LAW.
                </p>
                <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mt-4 text-sm">
                    Some jurisdictions do not allow certain limitations; in
                    those cases, liability is limited to the fullest extent
                    permitted by law.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3">
