                    There is no account-linked support inbox, since there is
                    no account. For questions about these Terms, open an
                    issue or discussion on the project's GitHub repository:
                    <a
                        href="https://github.com/apprenti-dev/apprentiapp"
                        class="text-link hover:underline"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/apprenti-dev/apprentiapp</a
                    >.
                </p>
            </section>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 flex gap-4 flex-wrap">
            <a href="/docs" class="text-sm text-link hover:underline"
                >← All Docs</a
            >
            <a href="/docs/privacy" class="text-sm text-link hover:underline"
                >Privacy Policy</a
            >
            <a href="/" class="text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:underline"
                >Back to apprenti.dev</a
            >
        </div>
    </div>
</DocsLayout>
